37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, your exhaustion is real, but my ledger shows the operating subsidy is already gutted. We cannot fund new routes without breaking the bank.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
